  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MIC 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aya arabanyore abagokorera abataka bobe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki erabe akong’u ase baria bakogeesa ase okoroberia amabe! Ekero bogokiamoka buna bakonyora ribaga rike baikerania obebe boria baroberetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero barabwo batagete emegondo baurereria; ekero batagete chinyomba bachiira rioka. Eamate teiyo gose enibo bire n’oborendi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Omonene nigo agoteeba, nigo ndoberetie koreta amaakwa ase more, nainwe timokonyaara koyatamboka. Ngochia more kwenyora ase obokong’u, naende timogochia konyara gotara n’obwerori naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero chingaki chirache, abanto mbabogorie omogano oino koba ekiorokererio k’iobobe, na nigo baratere ogoteera gw’okwerusia moyo igoro ase ayio mwaeteire:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Twatagokire kegima!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene otourire ense yaito naende oyeire abanto baria batoosete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bono ekero engaki eraike ense ekoiranigwa gochia ase abanto b’Omonene, onde oino taiyo oranyore egatari aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto nigo bakondanderia bateeba, Tobaisa gotorandia. Tobaisa korandia ayio onsi Omonene tari gochia gotoa obosoku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo okorengereria buna Abaisraeli nigo bare inse y’okoragererigwa? Nigo Omoika bw’Omonene asirie okoremereria kwaye? Ekeene ere nakore ebinto ebio? Tari gokwana ase obwororo ase baria bagokora ay’ekeene?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene airaneria, “Nigo mokoboera abanto bane buna ababisa. Abasacha nigo bakoirana korwa ase esegi, bakagerete ng’a mbare n’oborendi ase enka, korende nao more agwo moganyererete kobaboria chigoti chiabo korwa mareko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaseria abakungu b’abanto bane korwa ase chinka chiabo banchete, naende mwaunereirie abana babo ogosesenigwa kwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imoka mogende; borendi tiboiyo aiga naende. Ebibe biano biaragereirie aase aa gochia ase obosareku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanto aba nigo batagete omobani ogoetanana n’oborimo amo n’obong’ainereria boigo ogoteeba, ’nababaneire buna Edivai n’amarwa naumoke ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende nimbasangererie mbabeke amo inwe abanto bonsi ba Israeli abwo batigarete. Nimbarete amo buna ching’ondi chikoirana gocha ase riicho. Buna oboriisia boichire ching’ondi, ense yaino neichorwe naende n’abanto abange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene naigore chinchera ase bare naende abarae korwa ase obooswa. Mbasoke korwa ase ebiita bi’omochie omonene bagende bare n’obosibore. Omorwoti obo, Omonene obo bweka nere orabarae gochia isiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
